---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-8 animate-fade-in-up">
        About Me
      </h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">
          I'm a 4th-year Computer Engineering student specializing in Artificial Intelligence, Data, and Cloud Computing at [University Name].
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-4">My Technical Focus</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
          My work centers on building practical AI and data-driven solutions that solve real-world problems. I'm particularly interested in the intersection of machine learning, data engineering, and scalable backend systems.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
          I believe in engineering solutions that are not only accurate but also maintainable, scalable, and production-ready. This means I spend as much time thinking about system architecture, data pipelines, and API design as I do about model performance.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-4">What I'm Currently Building</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
          Right now, I'm focused on deepening my expertise in:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) systems and AI agents</li>
          <li>Predictive maintenance and industrial AI applications</li>
          <li>Data engineering pipelines and ETL workflows</li>
          <li>Cloud-native architecture and scalable system design</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-4">My Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
          I approach engineering problems with a data-first mindset. Before building models, I focus on understanding the data, cleaning it effectively, and building robust pipelines. I'm a strong believer in iterative development - starting simple, validating assumptions, and scaling solutions only when necessary.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
          I'm always learning, whether through building projects, reading research papers, or contributing to open source. The field of AI and data engineering moves quickly, and I believe staying current is essential to delivering real value.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-4">Career Direction</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
          I'm actively seeking opportunities in AI engineering, data engineering, and backend development roles where I can apply my skills to build impactful systems. I'm particularly interested in positions that involve:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Building and deploying ML models in production</li>
          <li>Designing data infrastructure and pipelines</li>
          <li>Developing AI-powered applications and services</li>
          <li>Working with modern cloud technologies and microservices</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-4">
            If you're interested in discussing potential opportunities or just want to chat about AI and data engineering, feel free to reach out.
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:yassinay25@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            yassinay25@gmail.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
